msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"I heard about a guy doing \"hit-and-stops\" on\r\n"
"Ryukyu Boulevard lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"What, jumping in front of cars and forcing them to pay for his \"medical "
"expenses\"? That's nothing new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "No, the \"hit-and-stop\" guy is way worse than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"He drives around aggressively like he's gonna hit someone, then slams on the"
" brakes at the last moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Then he claims you gave him whiplash or damaged his car or something and "
"uses that to extort you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Really? And this weirdo just cruises through Ryukyu Boulevard?"
msgstr ""

